{"info": {"address1": "East Wing, Plot-254 B, Nirlon House", "address2": "4th Floor Dr. Annie Besant Road, Worli", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400030", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6258 2898", "website": "https://www.metropolisindia.com", "industry": "Diagnostics & Research", "industryKey": "diagnostics-research", "industryDisp": "Diagnostics & Research", "sector": "Healthcare", "sectorKey": "healthcare", "sectorDisp": "Healthcare", "longBusinessSummary": "Metropolis Healthcare Limited, together with its subsidiaries, provides pathology and related healthcare services in India, Africa, South Asia, the Middle East, and internationally. The company offers routine and semi-specialised pathology tests; advanced diagnostics, including genetic, molecular, and cytogenetic testing; preventive healthcare packages and corporate wellness screening; and clinical trial research, hospital lab management, and home collection services, as well as profiles, blood tests, and soft radiology services. It also provides diagnostic services for oncology, neurology, gynecology, and nephrology, as well as various health check-up packages for men, women, senior citizens, youth, and corporates. In addition, the company develops and deals in technology driven products and services. The company serves a range of customers, including direct-to-consumer diagnostics through patient service centers, a mobile app, a website, and home collection; partnerships with standalone labs, hospital chains, and diagnostic networks; and institutional clients, such as corporates, government bodies, and hospital lab management services. Metropolis Healthcare Limited was founded in 1980 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Ameera Sushil Shah", "age": 46, "title": "Executive Chairperson", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 58918273, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Sushil Kanubhai Shah", "age": 79, "title":